  },
  {
    "INDEX": 6.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 10.1,
      "HIDE": 12.1
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "앞으로 빼면 되는 거구나!",
      "ENGLISH": "Oh, so that’s how you’re supposed to pull it out!",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "是要往前抽出来啊！",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "是往前抽出來就可以啊！",
      "JAPANESE": "前に引けばいいんだ!",
