      "INDONESIAN": "Kenapa kamu memakannya?!",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Por que tá comendo?!",
      "SPANISH": "¡¿Por qué te lo comes?!",
      "PERSIAN": "چرا خوردی؟!"
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 9.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 16.9,
      "HIDE": 18.1
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "도와달라면서요.",
      "ENGLISH": "You asked for help!",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "不是说要帮忙吗",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "不是你叫我幫忙的嗎？",
      "JAPANESE": "手伝ってって言ったじゃないですか",
      "INDONESIAN": "Kan kamu yang minta bantuan!",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Você disse pra eu te ajudar.",
      "SPANISH": "Dijiste que te ayudara.",
      "PERSIAN": "کمک خواستی!"
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 10.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 18.1,
      "HIDE": 19.7
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "먹는 거 도와달라는 거 아니었어요?",
      "ENGLISH": "You didn't ask me to eat it?",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "不是要我帮你吃的意思吗？",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "不是要你幫我吃的意思啊？",
      "JAPANESE": "食べるの手伝ってほしいんじゃなかったんですか?",
      "INDONESIAN": "Kamu tidak memintaku memakannya?",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Mas não pra comer!",
      "SPANISH": "¡Pero no que te lo comas!",
      "PERSIAN": "از من نخواستی بخورمش؟"
    }
  },
  {
    "INDEX": 11.0,
    "TIME": {
      "SHOW": 19.7,
      "HIDE": 22.8
    },
    "SCRIPT": {
      "KOREAN": "아니 어떻게 먹는 건지 알려달라는 거였죠!",
      "ENGLISH": "I meant show me how to eat it, not eat it for me!",
      "CHINESE_SIMPLIFIED": "是要你教我怎么吃才对啊！",
      "CHINESE_TRADITIONAL": "我是要你教我怎麼吃！",
      "JAPANESE": "違います! どうやって食べるのか教えてほしかったんですよ!",
      "INDONESIAN": "Maksudku tunjukkan padaku cara memakannya, bukan memakannya untukku!",
      "PORTUGUESE": "Só pra me mostrar como!",
      "SPANISH": "¡Solo que me enseñes cómo!",
      "PERSIAN": "منظورم این بود که به من نشان بده چگونه اونو بخورم، نه اینکه اونو برای من بخورم!"
    }
  },
  {
